+0000","Document","4803d45c-f857-4573-aa89-b30385ccc7a7",false,{"link_type":18},[23,58,94,118,178,205,241],{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":26,"primary":28,"id":56,"slice_type":57,"slice_label":29},"default-slice","sktwi1xtmkfgx8626",[27],{},{"theme":29,"PageHeaderTitle":30,"PageHeaderText":31,"PageHeaderCtaText":36,"PageHeaderCtaUrl":37,"secondaryCtaText":29,"secondaryCtaLabel":29,"secondaryCtaUrl":41,"PageHeaderImage":43,"heroImage":54,"videoContent":55,"showPremiumLogo":29},null,"Send a parcel without using a printer",[32],{"type":33,"text":34,"spans":35},"paragraph","No printer? No problem! Print your label at a ParcelShop",[],"Find your nearest ParcelShop",{"link_type":38,"key":39,"url":40},"Web","692c4ccd-7153-4e22-b8d7-25f547610dcc","print-in-parcelshop.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ffind-a-parcelshop",{"link_type":42},"Any",{"dimensions":44,"alt":47,"copyright":29,"url":48,"id":49,"edit":50},{"width":45,"height":46},300,69,"Print","print-in-parcelshop.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F6ef8e28d-1ca2-4a9a-8ef3-ce02086ef01d_print.svg","YhYpMRIAAC4A0QB_",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":53},0,1,"#fff",{},{"link_type":18},"page_header$0c76976d-e057-4eb5-a1d4-986ec5bd3a7f","page_header",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":59,"primary":61,"id":92,"slice_type":93,"slice_label":29},[60],{},{"CardImage":62,"CardAvatar":72,"CardTitle":73,"CardText":74,"ButtonText":29,"ButtonUrl":91,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":63,"alt":66,"copyright":29,"url":67,"id":68,"edit":69},{"width":64,"height":65},1000,667,"Customer in a ParcelShop store holding their mobile phone and entering information on a Print in Store device for printing their label.","print-in-parcelshop.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TIvJbqstJ9-Te3_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2007.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=51%2C0%2C6330%2C4222&w=1000&h=667","Z6TIvJbqstJ9-Te3",{"x":70,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":71},51,"transparent","none","What is an Evri Print in ParcelShop device?",[75,79,85,88],{"type":33,"text":76,"spans":77,"direction":78},"You'll find Print In ParcelShop devices in most of our ParcelShops. They’re easy and convenient to use, without the queues. You can use them to:",[],"ltr",{"type":33,"text":80,"spans":81,"direction":78},"Print labels in seconds – you don’t need a printer at home to send or return a parcel. Just book your parcel online to receive your Print In ParcelShop QR code, then once your parcel is boxed up you’re ready to make your way to a ParcelShop. ",[82],{"start":51,"end":83,"type":84},24,"strong",{"type":33,"text":86,"spans":87,"direction":78},"Our Print In ParcelShop devices are completely self-serve, minimising delays in getting your parcel on the move. One of our trusted in-store partners will always be present to help you out if you’re having trouble. ",[],{"type":33,"text":89,"spans":90,"direction":78},"*Excludes Postable parcels",[],{"link_type":42},"card$5bcde8c6-6f3f-43b4-84ce-b6934001203f","card",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":95,"primary":97,"id":117,"slice_type":93,"slice_label":29},[96],{},{"CardImage":98,"CardAvatar":72,"CardTitle":104,"CardText":105,"ButtonText":29,"ButtonUrl":116,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":99,"alt":100,"copyright":29,"url":101,"id":102,"edit":103},{"width":64,"height":65},"Evri blue ParcelShop sign hung from the ceiling of a store in one of the aisles. Stock on shelves is visible in the background.","print-in-parcelshop.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2888.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJPZbqstJ9-Tf4",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":71},"Convenient, cheap and hassle free!",[106],{"type":33,"text":107,"spans":108},"We see ParcelShops and our Print In ParcelShop devices as an easy alternative to many traditional postal services. Our ParcelShops have longer opening hours, most are open 7 days a week and have parking nearby.",[109,112],{"start":110,"end":111,"type":84},7,18,{"start":110,"end":111,"type":113,"data":114},"hyperlink",{"link_type":38,"url":115},"print-in-parcelshop.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":42},"card$b458f124-4afe-4931-baaf-b9282f48aec6",{"variation":119,"version":25,"items":120,"primary":172,"id":176,"slice_type":177,"slice_label":29},"photoListComponent",[121,134,146,158],{"title":122,"content":123,"isNumbered":127,"image":128},"Book and pay",[124],{"type":33,"text":125,"spans":126},"Book and pay for you parcel online, using our website or app",[],true,{"dimensions":129,"alt":130,"copyright":29,"url":131,"id":132,"edit":133},{"width":64,"height":65},"An older couple, a man and a woman, are sat on a sofa. They are laughing whilst using a laptop.","print-in-parcelshop.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6oy_pbqstJ9-cW7_EVRI_LOCATION_06_10821.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6oy_pbqstJ9-cW7",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":71},{"title":135,"content":136,"isNumbered":127,"image":140},"Code or label",[137],{"type":33,"text":138,"spans":139},"You can then choose to get a code, instead of a parcel label",[],{"dimensions":141,"alt":142,"copyright":29,"url":143,"id":144,"edit":145},{"width":64,"height":65},"A side-profile view of a customer sitting on a sofa in their lounge, holding their mobile phone and looking at their screen.","print-in-parcelshop.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6Xsw5bqstJ9-We8_EVRI_LOCATION_04_5361.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6Xsw5bqstJ9-We8",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":71},{"title":147,"content":148,"isNumbered":127,"image":152},"Use Print in ParcelShop device",[149],{"type":33,"text":150,"spans":151},"Go to a ParcelShop with a Print In ParcelShop device",[],{"dimensions":153,"alt":154,"copyright":29,"url":155,"id":156,"edit":157},{"width":64,"height":65},"Customer walking towards a ParcelShop store holding a parcel. The blue Evri signage can be seen on the storefront with a free-standing sign near the entrance.","print-in-parcelshop.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2863.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJL5bqstJ9-Tf1",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":71},{"title":159,"content":160,"isNumbered":127,"image":164},"Scan or type code",[161],{"type":33,"text":162,"spans":163},"Scan or type your code and the Print In ParcelShop device prints your label",[],{"dimensions":165,"alt":167,"copyright":29,"url":168,"id":169,"edit":170},{"width":64,"height":166},665,"A close-up of a customer applying a label to their parcel. A ParcelShop Print in Store device is in view behind the parcel.","print-in-parcelshop.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJbpbqstJ9-TgK_EVRI_LOCATION_PIS2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C6%2C6707%2C4460&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJbpbqstJ9-TgK",{"x":51,"y":171,"zoom":52,"background":71},6,{"theme":173,"title":174,"description":175},"standard","Book and pay online, print in the ParcelShop","Whether you’re sending or returning a parcel, you can book and pay online, then use a QR code to print a label. Here’s how it works:","list_block$5b5abbd0-f159-4517-9348-e2dd98bba1f8","list_block",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":179,"primary":181,"id":203,"slice_type":204,"slice_label":29},[180],{},{"Image":182},{"dimensions":183,"alt":186,"copyright":29,"url":187,"id":188,"edit":189,"mobile":191,"tablet":197},{"width":184,"height":185},1200,280,"A close-up of a ParcelShop Print in Store device printing a label. A hand is holding the label, ready to tear off and apply to the parcel.","print-in-parcelshop.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJaJbqstJ9-TgG_EVRI_LOCATION_PIS1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C260%2C5994%2C1399&w=1200&h=280","Z6TJaJbqstJ9-TgG",{"x":51,"y":190,"zoom":52,"background":71},260,{"dimensions":192,"alt":186,"copyright":29,"url":195,"id":188,"edit":196},{"width":193,"height":194},343,160,"print-in-parcelshop.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJaJbqstJ9-TgG_EVRI_LOCATION_PIS1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C0%2C5994%2C2796&w=343&h=160",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":71},{"dimensions":198,"alt":186,"copyright":29,"url":201,"id":188,"edit":202},{"width":199,"height":200},704,240,"print-in-parcelshop.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJaJbqstJ9-TgG_EVRI_LOCATION_PIS1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C0%2C5994%2C2043&w=704&h=240",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":71},"photo_block$ee48c5f1-fdd3-4b76-8b1c-66a84eaf4d34","photo_block",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":206,"primary":237,"id":240,"slice_type":177,"slice_label":29},[207,212,217,222,227,232],{"title":208,"content":209,"isNumbered":127,"icon":210,"image":211},"Weigh and measure your parcel once it’s fully packaged.",[],{},{},{"title":213,"content":214,"isNumbered":127,"icon":215,"image":216},"Book your parcel online, choosing either Standard or Next Day delivery, and selecting ParcelShop drop off.",[],{},{},{"title":218,"content":219,"isNumbered":127,"icon":220,"image":221},"Fill in all of yours’ and your recipients’ details so we can make sure your parcel is delivered safely.",[],{},{},{"title":223,"content":224,"isNumbered":127,"icon":225,"image":226},"Checkout to receive your Print In Store QR code.",[],{},{},{"title":228,"content":229,"isNumbered":127,"icon":230,"image":231},"Bring your parcel and QR code to a ParcelShop and scan it at the device.",[],{},{},{"title":233,"content":234,"isNumbered":127,"icon":235,"image":236},"Your label is then printed. All you need to do then is stick the label on your parcel, and hand it to a member of store staff",[],{},{},{"theme":173,"title":238,"description":239,"showPaddingTop":20},"Book your parcel online to use a Print In ParcelShop device","With Evri, it’s easy to send a parcel with no printer required. With our simple online booking process, we’ll take all the details we need for you to head to your local ParcelShop and get your label printed. All you need to do is:","list_block$07dce109-2e20-441c-8c28-f1c7a751fe19",{"variation":242,"version":25,"items":243,"primary":245,"id":276,"slice_type":93,"slice_label":29},"cardWithImageNoCta",[244],{},{"CardImage":246,"CardAvatar":72,"CardTitle":252,"CardText":253,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":247,"alt":248,"copyright":29,"url":249,"id":250,"edit":251},{"width":64,"height":65},"Customer standing outside with a blue Evri Locker in the background. They are holding a parcel and smiling for the photo.","print-in-parcelshop.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi",{"x":51,"y":51,"zoom":52,"background":71},"Print your parcel labels at a Locker",[254,257,261,264,267,270,273],{"type":33,"text":255,"spans":256,"direction":78},"You can also easily print your parcel labels FOR FREE at an Evri Locker. Here’s how: ",[],{"type":258,"text":259,"spans":260,"direction":78},"o-list-item","Book your parcel online or via our app and select your preferred Evri Locker.",[],{"type":258,"text":262,"spans":263,"direction":78},"When you complete your order, you’ll receive a QR code.",[],{"type":258,"text":265,"spans":266,"direction":78},"Scan the QR code at the Locker terminal to print your label there and then!",[],{"type":258,"text":268,"spans":269,"direction":78},"Attach the label to your parcel. ",[],{"type":258,"text":271,"spans":272,"direction":78},"Scan your barcode or manually enter the 16-digit barcode number to open a door. ",[],{"type":258,"text":274,"spans":275,"direction":78},"Place the parcel inside, close the door, and we’ll do the rest!",[],"card$4eeab818-77eb-4290-8f96-0b3a06a8c4dc",[23,58,94,118,178,205,241],["Reactive",279],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":280,"$sclients":346,"$sglobal-basket-count":29},{"abtasty":281,"accessibe":284,"appPromoBanner":287,"autoDivertUpdates":290,"awin":293,"bulkInternational":296,"bulkSendEnabled":299,"businessAccountForm75En